        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SlayBall Brick Breaker is a fast, endlessly re-playable arcade brick-smashing game built for pure momentum and brag-worthy score chasing. Pick between three difficulty levels, then dive straight into a fresh, procedurally generated layout every time. Clear a board, watch a new one snap into place, and keep climbing that score ladder until your last life burns out. You start with three lives and a storm of hexagon bricks standing in your way. Grab power-ups to boost your speed and firepower, dodge the power-downs waiting to sabotage your run, and push for a new personal best. Every attempt adds to the tension. Every bounce feels earned. Track your past high scores. Study your victories. Try to beat the version of you from yesterday. Featuring original art, a crisp soundtrack, and a sleek visual style built to keep you locked in and hungry for just one more round. Break everything. Rise higher. Play again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SlayBall Brick Breaker is a fast, endlessly re-playable arcade brick-smashing game built for pure momentum and brag-worthy score chasing. Pick between three difficulty levels, then dive straight into a fresh, procedurally generated layout every time. Clear a board, watch a new one snap into place, and keep climbing that score ladder until your last life burns out. You start with three lives and a storm of hexagon bricks standing in your way. Grab power-ups to boost your speed and firepower, dodge the power-downs waiting to sabotage your run, and push for a new personal best. Every attempt adds to the tension. Every bounce feels earned. Track your past high scores. Study your victories. Try to beat the version of you from yesterday. Featuring original art, a crisp soundtrack, and a sleek visual style built to keep you locked in and hungry for just one more round. Break everything. Rise higher. Play again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "SlayBall Brick Breaker is a fun twist on classic Brick Breaker games. Play an endless arcade mode where you put your skills to the test as you try and destroy as many bricks as possible and beat your high score.",
